 "brief": "Settlers established a new outpost on agricultural land in Jaba, a town south of Jenin, Shehab Wire reported. Jaba's mayor Muhammad al-Badad said settlers had stormed the Jabal Harish area east of the town over the past two weeks and set up the settlement outpost.\n\nThe action marks the latest in a pattern of outpost construction on Palestinian land in the northern West Bank.",
